{"seq":1,"slug":"mapreduce-evolution","title":"MapReduce 演进：从批处理到统一计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing/mapreduce-evolution","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"mapreduce-演进-从批处理到统一计算\">MapReduce 演进：从批处理到统一计算</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>MapReduce 是大数据批处理的开山之作，其&quot;分而治之&quot;的计算模型奠定了分布式数据处理的基础范式。从 2004 年 Google 发表论文到 2026 年的今天，批处理技术经历了从 Hadoop MapReduce 到 Apache Spark 再到现代统一计算引擎的三代演进。尽管流处理在实时场景中崭露头角，批处理在大规模历史数据分析、模型训练和数据仓库 ETL 中仍然不可替代。</p>\n<p>本文回顾批处理技术的演进脉络，深入分析各代计算引擎的架构差异，帮助工程师理解现代数据处理系统的设计根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"mapreduce-编程模型\">MapReduce 编程模型</h3><p>MapReduce 将任意分布式计算抽象为两个函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Map: 将输入拆分为键值对&#10;def map(key, value):&#10;    # 输入: 一行文本&#10;    for word in value.split():&#10;        emit(word, 1)&#10;&#10;# Reduce: 按键聚合值&#10;def reduce(key, values):&#10;    # 输入: 一个词和它的计数列表&#10;    emit(key, sum(values))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Map: 将输入拆分为键值对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 输入: 一行文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value.split():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        emit(word, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Reduce: 按键聚合值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, values):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 输入: 一个词和它的计数列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emit(key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>MapReduce 执行流程：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Input Splits&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Map Phase&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Shuffle and Sort&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Reduce Phase&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Output&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Input Splits\"] --&gt; B[\"Map Phase\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Shuffle and Sort\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Reduce Phase\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Output\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>I/O 模式</th>\n<th>并行度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Input Split</td>\n<td>将输入分为固定大小块</td>\n<td>顺序读 HDFS</td>\n<td>由数据块数决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td>对每条记录执行 map 函数</td>\n<td>内存处理</td>\n<td>与 Split 数相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shuffle</td>\n<td>按 key 重新分发到 Reducer</td>\n<td>网络传输 + 磁盘写</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sort</td>\n<td>按 key 排序</td>\n<td>外部排序</td>\n<td>每个 Reducer 独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reduce</td>\n<td>按 key 聚合</td>\n<td>顺序读排序结果</td>\n<td>由分区数决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Output</td>\n<td>写入 HDFS</td>\n<td>顺序写</td>\n<td>与 Reducer 数相同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mapreduce-的局限性\">MapReduce 的局限性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多轮磁盘 I/O</td>\n<td>每个 Job 的中间结果写入 HDFS</td>\n<td>迭代算法极慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高延迟</td>\n<td>Job 调度开销 + 磁盘 I/O</td>\n<td>不适合交互式查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力不足</td>\n<td>只有 Map 和 Reduce 两个算子</td>\n<td>复杂 ETL 需要多个 Job 串联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无内存缓存</td>\n<td>中间结果不驻留内存</td>\n<td>相同数据重复读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错开销大</td>\n<td>细粒度任务重执行</td>\n<td>慢任务拖累整体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"apache-spark-的革命\">Apache Spark 的革命</h3><p>Spark 通过 RDD（弹性分布式数据集）和内存计算解决了 MapReduce 的核心问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession&#10;&#10;spark = SparkSession.builder.appName(&quot;WordCount&quot;).getOrCreate()&#10;&#10;# Spark 的声明式 API (DataFrame)&#10;df = spark.read.text(&quot;hdfs:///data/logs/*.txt&quot;)&#10;word_counts = (&#10;    df.selectExpr(&quot;explode(split(value, &#39; &#39;)) as word&quot;)&#10;      .groupBy(&quot;word&quot;)&#10;      .count()&#10;      .orderBy(&quot;count&quot;, ascending=False)&#10;)&#10;word_counts.show(20)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession.builder.appName(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WordCount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).getOrCreate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Spark 的声明式 API (DataFrame)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spark.read.text(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hdfs:///data/logs/*.txt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">word_counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df.selectExpr(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explode(split(value, ' ')) as word\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .groupBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"word\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .count()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .orderBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ascending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">word_counts.show(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Spark vs MapReduce 架构对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MapReduce</th>\n<th>Spark</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行模型</td>\n<td>多个独立 Job，每个 Job 写 HDFS</td>\n<td>单个 DAG，中间结果驻留内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间数据</td>\n<td>磁盘（HDFS）</td>\n<td>内存（溢出到磁盘）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错</td>\n<td>重新执行 Map/Reduce 任务</td>\n<td>基于 RDD Lineage 重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度</td>\n<td>按 Job 调度</td>\n<td>按 Stage/Task 调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>Map + Reduce</td>\n<td>丰富的转换和动作算子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代计算</td>\n<td>每轮迭代一个 Job</td>\n<td>数据驻留内存，迭代极快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Spark 的 DAG 执行引擎：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Read Parquet&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Filter age &gt; 30&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Map: extract fields&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Shuffle: groupBy city&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Aggregate: count, avg&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Write Result&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Stage 1 - No Shuffle&quot;&#10;        A&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Stage 2 - After Shuffle&quot;&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[\"Read Parquet\"] --&gt; B[\"Filter age &gt; 30\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Map: extract fields\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Shuffle: groupBy city\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Aggregate: count, avg\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Write Result\"]\n\n    subgraph \"Stage 1 - No Shuffle\"\n        A\n        B\n        C\n    end\n    subgraph \"Stage 2 - After Shuffle\"\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"现代统一计算引擎\">现代统一计算引擎</h3><p>2026 年的批处理格局已经从&quot;Spark 一统天下&quot;演变为多引擎竞争：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apache Spark</td>\n<td>Scala/Python</td>\n<td>通用批处理 + ML</td>\n<td>生态最完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Flink (Batch)</td>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>批流统一</td>\n<td>真正的流处理统一批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DuckDB</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>嵌入式分析</td>\n<td>零配置，单机极致性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polars</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>DataFrame 分析</td>\n<td>内存效率，比 Pandas 快 10-100x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Daft</td>\n<td>Rust/Python</td>\n<td>分布式 DataFrame</td>\n<td>本地到集群无缝扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Databricks Photon</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>Spark 加速</td>\n<td>向量化 C++ 执行 Spark SQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trino (Presto)</td>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>交互式查询</td>\n<td>联邦查询多数据源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"spark-性能优化实践\">Spark 性能优化实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 1. 避免数据倾斜: 使用 salting 技术&#10;from pyspark.sql.functions import col, concat, lit, rand&#10;&#10;# 热点键 salting&#10;num_salts = 10&#10;salted_df = (&#10;    large_df&#10;    .withColumn(&quot;salt&quot;, (rand() * num_salts).cast(&quot;int&quot;))&#10;    .withColumn(&quot;salted_key&quot;, concat(col(&quot;join_key&quot;), lit(&quot;_&quot;), col(&quot;salt&quot;)))&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 小表 explode salts&#10;salted_small = (&#10;    small_df&#10;    .crossJoin(spark.range(num_salts).withColumnRenamed(&quot;id&quot;, &quot;salt&quot;))&#10;    .withColumn(&quot;salted_key&quot;, concat(col(&quot;join_key&quot;), lit(&quot;_&quot;), col(&quot;salt&quot;)))&#10;)&#10;&#10;result = salted_df.join(salted_small, &quot;salted_key&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 2. 使用 Adaptive Query Execution (AQE)&#10;spark.conf.set(&quot;spark.sql.adaptive.enabled&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;spark.conf.set(&quot;spark.sql.adaptive.coalescePartitions.enabled&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;spark.conf.set(&quot;spark.sql.adaptive.skewJoin.enabled&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 3. 选择合适的 Join 策略&#10;# 小表 &lt; 10MB → Broadcast Hash Join (避免 Shuffle)&#10;spark.conf.set(&quot;spark.sql.autoBroadcastJoinThreshold&quot;, &quot;10485760&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 避免数据倾斜: 使用 salting 技术</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql.functions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col, concat, lit, rand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 热点键 salting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_salts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">salted_df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    large_df</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .withColumn(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (rand() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_salts).cast(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"int\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .withColumn(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salted_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, concat(col(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"join_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), lit(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"_\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), col(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 小表 explode salts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">salted_small </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    small_df</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .crossJoin(spark.range(num_salts).withColumnRenamed(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .withColumn(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salted_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, concat(col(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"join_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), lit(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"_\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), col(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E